uVolley 2023

NEWS

- Trial mode as first option;
- Full play on all views;
- Match statistics;
- Judges line redesigned;
- Gameplay changes;

and more...

Note about Easy Mode :

Easy mode is an option that you find on ball menu and leave the player to automatic movement and play the game by only press the shot buttons, you can uncheck this option in all view when you are ready to full control your player.

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/38213765/4c34dcb9b6f854be6f132065f862c4601fcc6a0d.png[/img]

uVolley 2022 released !!!

NEWS

- LIBERO ready to play;
- EASY MODE play as default;
- Australia team added;
- More teams redesigned;

Best Regards...

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/38213765/395c572891f22253fc9e865dc805fbba44f1a979.png[/img]

Note about Easy Mode :

Easy mode is an option that you find on ball menu and leave the player to automatic movement and play the game by only press the shot buttons, you can uncheck this option in the front view when you are ready to full control your player.

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/38213765/883c07da9c9c826dd9d194baf4eb5e21e14e5034.png[/img]

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/38213765/5cac40f8cbcfb368765795def0a4056c3f1a85a9.png[/img]

League is like an international competition where 16 teams matches to win a medal;

Start to choose your preferred 16 teams or leave uVolley to automatic fill the leaderboard;

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/38213765/818c352b33741e3a2d605368fd03f46d423d1669.png[/img]

Four groups compete with each others for five weeks;

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/38213765/74d82ce8cf25b850fd837bc46cf25da0d1240f8c.png[/img]

After five weeks the first six teams of leaderboard are divided in two groups and compete with each others;

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/38213765/f7f92a726d22a244f77db03d9bbec9f4ab105d9b.png[/img]

After the "FINAL SIX" there is the "FINAL FOUR" where the first classified of the group one match with the second classified of the group two and the first classified of the group two match with the second classified of the group one;

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/38213765/6d15e64e90f1c7feee8de07a35d51b01e2c896a3.png[/img]

After the "FINAL FOUR" there is the "FINAL TWO" or semifinals, where the first classified of the leaderboard match with the second classified and the third classified match with the fourth classified;

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/38213765/7e23939eb8fd94b013c7e8ffe74105d53a9864d6.png[/img]

At the end the medals assigned;

[img]{STEAM_CLAN_IMAGE}/38213765/97ec06bb098bc86411dd081ec23c778cb779133e.png[/img]

The good news is that you can play each match or skip each phase to play only the most important matches until you reach the final...
